## Placeholder reference

| Placeholder | Replace with |
|---|---|
| `<SOURCE_REPOSITORY>` | Full URL of the QLI-DevBox repository (e.g. `https://github.com/QLI-Quantum-Leap-Innovations/QLI-DevBox`) |
| `<SOURCE_BRANCH>` | Branch in the QLI-DevBox repository at time of installation |
| `<SOURCE_COMMIT>` | Commit SHA in the QLI-DevBox repository at time of installation |
| `<SOURCE_SERVER_PATH>` | Absolute path on the live server (`/srv/dev/foundation/devbox/current/`) |
| `<INSTALLED_AT>` | ISO 8601 date and time of installation (e.g. `2026-05-24T14:00:00Z`) |
| `<INSTALLED_BY_ROLE>` | Role of the installer, not a personal username (e.g. `DevBox Operator`) |
| `<FOUNDATION_SCHEMA_VERSION>` | Schema version from the source foundation material (e.g. `1`) |
